e-4708-bd33-80358a9acaf2\":\"About Us\",\"dd2edb48-b8fa-4f95-b0a0-5581ec7e8ad6\":\"Privacy policy\",\"3ae1321a-7b5f-486e-80c5-d0316df871bb\":\"Success Stories\",\"acdd4877-c2fb-4d44-af88-60659958e455\":\"Partner with us\",\"caaaeb9a-a172-4efb-b669-4a030043a77a\":\"Sitemap\",\"af97888e-f41d-407b-99a9-d2ab31166de8\":\"Quick Menu\",\"cd30aefc-4070-4da0-ad1a-5c30ae15981a\":\"LivMonitor 360\",\"homeS9H1T1\":\"Frequently Asked\",\"homeS9H1T2\":\"\\u003cspan class=\\\"lgs-text-highlighted\\\"\\u003eQuestions\\u003c/span\\u003e\",\"homeS9T3P1\":\"Looking for service resolution?\",\"homeS9T3P2\":\"Contact us at\",\"homeS9T3P3\":\"+91 9999039039\",\"homeS9T3P4\":\"at any day of the week between 9 am to 6 pm, and our team will resolve it within 48 hours!\",\"9178cf63-844b-42e9-a59f-6f121f526210\":\"Want more information on Solar? Find your answers here\",\"successT1\":\"Thank \\u003cbr /\\u003e You!\",\"successT2\":\"Hang on, you'll receive a \\u003cbr /\\u003e call from our team soon\",\"successT3\":\"Till then, show some love to our \\u003cbr /\\u003e social handles!\",\"contactUsT1\":\"Connect with Livguard Solar Expert Today\",\"contactUsT3\":\"Name\",\"contactUsT4\":\"Email\",\"contactUsT2\":\"Phone Number\",\"phoneNumberChange\":\"Change\",\"OfferFormGetOTP\":\"Get OTP\",\"contactUsOTPT3E\":\"Please Enter Your OTP\",\"OfferInvalidOTP\":\"Invalid OTP\",\"OfferResendOTP\":\"Resend OTP\",\"termsAndConditionsCheckboxtext\":\"\\u003cdiv class=\\\"tw-text-[12px] lgs-text-secondary-700\\\"\\u003eI accept the \\u003ca href=\\\"https://www.livguard.com/terms-and-conditions.php\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"lgs-text-secondary-900 tw-font-semibold\\\"\\u003eterm of use\\u003c/a\\u003e \\u0026 \\u003ca href=\\\"https://www.livguard.com/privacy-policy.php\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"lgs-text-secondary-900 tw-font-semibold\\\"\\u003ePrivacy policy\\u003c/a\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"contactUsT5\":\"Submit\",\"21f8d532-cf0d-4e52-a4c0-0b2d6069ed85\":\"Go Solar in \\u003cspan class=\\\"lgs-text-highlighted\\\"\\u003e4 Simple Steps\\u003c/span\\u003e\",\"0103a1d4-4203-4de1-995a-4668fe945c31\":\"1. Use our Solculator to explore solutions\",\"979e962f-dbb5-4646-8cc0-19a208599727\":\"Share your information with Solculator, our tool that assesses your needs and suggests tailored solutions to meet them. If you're unsure about the details, don't worry—our Solar Experts are here to guide you. Getting started with solar is easy; we're just a call, contact form, or a visit away! We're here to make your solar journey simple, empowered, and hassle-free.\",\"2ac6284a-daca-4c4a-8919-41d207d24a1b\":\"2. Get free call and on-site consultation\",\"d3246cb6-cc32-447b-a1b9-7de6f7ded0dd\":\"If necessary, we may give you a call to understand your needs and determine if solar is right for you. If it is, we'll recommend the best options. We'll also arrange a visit to your home to assess factors like available space, energy needs, and roof suitability. For even smarter solutions, contact us at \\u003ca href=\\\"tel:9999039039\\\" class=\\\"tw-underline\\\"\\u003e9999039039\\u003c/a\\u003e, and consider our consulting package, which includes Enermap and Sunsensor. Sunsensor checks your rooftop's sun exposure, while Enermap analyzes your energy usage patterns, helping us design the ideal solution for you.\",\"14e42d99-9610-4afb-b63d-35e52ce8fea5\":\"3. Designing and installation of solutions\",\"699aa996-77a1-4000-80a1-6ddfc930b1a1\":\"Using the data we gather, we'll create a system design that suits your needs. Our techno-commercial offer will provide you with all the details, including products, services, payment procedures, and more. To ensure you're well-informed, our Solar Expert dealers will guide you through the steps, explain the pros and cons of available solutions, and make the right recommendations within your budget. Once you approve our quote, we'll handle permits, gather products, and when everything is ready, our skilled team will put together your solar masterpiece.\",\"519f20fe-af01-4817-b310-7b40fea7db76\":\"4. Experience limitless energy with tailor-fit solutions\",\"2fe4ec5f-1ae3-41b1-92bb-086f6f2cd351\":\"After all the systems are connected, our service engineer will conduct a system audit. Once it's up and running, we'll provide instructions on how to maintain it for optimal results. You can track your savings in real-time through our monitoring app, LivMonitor 360 and for a larger view, use our website dashboard. Sit back, relax, and watch your money-saving machine exceed your expectations. We offer 24*7 system performance monitoring. If you encounter any issues, simply call us or \\u003ca href=\\\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.smartinverter\\\" class=\\\"tw-underline\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noreferrer\\\"\\u003eraise a ticket from our app.\\u003c/a\\u003e\",\"headerMenuS1T6\":\"Dealer Locator\",\"c81fcd84-abb4-4f55-a9db-7519810530d9\":\"Talk to Expert\",\"a515dc81-6839-4000-9362-00390c183084\":\"Solculator\",\"8a98720c-b42c-4733-987b-2c0e4b93d433\":\"Enquiry\",\"0b676e5c-95ac-4d48-9ca7-34eaa305ab8a\":\"9999039039\",\"b25fb410-7ec3-47d6-8148-b81302dcbf1d\":\"Connect With Expert\",\"02f6101a-8dae-4b79-b916-6af72ee8719a\":\"Get In Touch With Us\",\"a9df86f8-881c-4ea4-a529-d54c91994062\":\"Why Livguard Solar\",\"b325205d-7c5d-4ecd-bc18-915f66b10318\":\"Livguard Solar Impact\",\"e65b7968-f676-46d5-a2c0-b8ec6ebba96d\":\"Why Go Solar\",\"8c3b0d50-e3a0-4889-aa47-529c3351aac1\":\"Explore Solar Savings\",\"5e3afb18-fdbf-4c47-94c6-432e731f5755\":\"Livguard Solar in 4 steps\",\"0604f173-2b7e-4eee-bd81-4c93d8f0c358\":\"Livguard Projects\",\"f33a8c4c-5949-4ce4-bb63-c5f717d4d2d4\":\"Categories\",\"e8aa2dbb-ade8-4124-bb58-fc4070859af7\":\"Dive Into Solar\",\"ba00b379-eb03-4560-9650-0dffb3d4ce7a\":\"Contact Us\",\"homeS10T3\":\"Find My Dealer\",\"2d8630fa-9bd5-4ca7-aa34-aeaa48f79a49\":\"Testimonials\",\"b909e9d3-23d2-4d80-8e38-bc29a1fb6578\":\"FAQs\",\"96e95286-15e7-4d0a-aecb-82056d